Wherefore art thou Romeo ?
Thou hast betrayed me .
What light through yonder window breaks ?
Is this a dagger which I see before me ?
I pray thee , tell me thy name .
Thou art a villain .
Dost thou love me ?
I know not why I am so sad .
Methinks the lady doth protest too much .
'Tis but thy name that is my enemy .
Wilt thou be gone ?
I will not speak with thee .
Come hither , sirrah .
Thy father hath three daughters .
Prithee , do not weep .
Whither goest thou ?
Thou shalt not die .
Nay , I will go with thee .
Canst thou tell me where Portia is ?
Hast thou seen my brother ?
